{"id":"bd644b6a31616fc0","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-low2-uniform-property.md","title":"Low₂ 的 0′ 统一下锥性质","display":"df-low2-uniform-property — Low₂ 的 0′ 统一下锥性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-low2-uniform-property","aliases":["20-df-low2-uniform-property"],"display":"df-low2-uniform-property — Low₂ 的 0′ 统一下锥性质","chapter":"4","section":"4.9","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 4.9.1","source_printed_pages":[102],"source_pdf_pages":[138],"depends_on":["[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]","[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-df-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-low2-uniform-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-low2-uniform-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-low2-uniform-property — Low₂ 的 0′ 统一下锥性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.9"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 4.9.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>102</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ConeChar}(A)=\\{\\chi_Y:Y\\le_T A\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{ConeChar}(A)=\\{\\chi_Y:Y\\le_T A\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}low2-uniform-property}\\vdash\nU(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Uniform}_{\\varnothing\\prime}(\\mathsf{ConeChar}(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}low2-uniform-property}\\vdash\nU(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Uniform}_{\\varnothing\\prime}(\\mathsf{ConeChar}(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>矩阵必须全定义、二值，每行恰为一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算集合，且每个这样的集合均出现。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(A)\">\\(U(A)\\)</span> 是谓词缩写；此处不预先假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T0\\prime\\)</span>，因为它是该性质推出的结论。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 4.9.1；印刷页 102；PDF 第 138 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-matrix","status":"resol